{"mode":"words","text":"Teraz słuchaj tekstu i czytaj go jednocześnie. Jako początkujący czytaj wyjaśnienia w swoim języku ojczystym, słuchaj języka docelowego w wolnym tempie i często zatrzymuj odtwarzanie — w ten sposób twój umysł kojarzy dźwięk z znaczeniem. Jeśli jesteś na poziomie zaawansowanym, czytaj tekst oryginalny i spoglądaj w dół tylko w przypadku nieznanych słów. Korzystaj przy tym często z powtórzeń A-B: zaznacz pojedyncze zdanie i odtwarzaj je w pętli — wypróbuj to powyżej.","words":[{"s":0,"e":673},{"s":940,"e":1533},{"s":1637,"e":2345},{"s":2821,"e":2949},{"s":3007,"e":3332},{"s":3390,"e":3506},{"s":3576,"e":4772},{"s":5526,"e":5851},{"s":5898,"e":7105},{"s":7651,"e":8034},{"s":8127,"e":8928},{"s":8986,"e":9009},{"s":9079,"e":9543},{"s":9636,"e":10252},{"s":10321,"e":11494},{"s":11900,"e":12341},{"s":12399,"e":12864},{"s":12910,"e":13897},{"s":14304,"e":14350},{"s":14536,"e":15047},{"s":15151,"e":15848},{"s":16603,"e":16765},{"s":16858,"e":17555},{"s":17741,"e":18576},{"s":18646,"e":19819},{"s":20086,"e":20132},{"s":20318,"e":20364},{"s":20422,"e":20585},{"s":20713,"e":21374},{"s":21479,"e":21746},{"s":21850,"e":22419},{"s":22477,"e":23267},{"s":23615,"e":24381},{"s":24509,"e":24544},{"s":24648,"e":25763},{"s":26959,"e":27365},{"s":27423,"e":27830},{"s":27922,"e":27992},{"s":28039,"e":28515},{"s":28573,"e":30001},{"s":30546,"e":30895},{"s":30999,"e":31336},{"s":31394,"e":32427},{"s":32903,"e":33031},{"s":33089,"e":33948},{"s":34041,"e":34087},{"s":34192,"e":34540},{"s":35190,"e":35573},{"s":35608,"e":35643},{"s":35701,"e":36560},{"s":37036,"e":37907},{"s":37977,"e":38685},{"s":39440,"e":40148},{"s":40206,"e":40368},{"s":40415,"e":40577},{"s":40635,"e":41100},{"s":41146,"e":41169},{"s":41262,"e":41889},{"s":42028,"e":43201},{"s":44072,"e":44791},{"s":44826,"e":45500},{"s":45558,"e":46254},{"s":46800,"e":46986},{"s":47113,"e":48147},{"s":48216,"e":48286},{"s":48333,"e":48391},{"s":48460,"e":49157},{"s":49296,"e":49354},{"s":49761,"e":50666},{"s":50736